@AtakanErmis Thanks for that. I'd completely forgotten about combo and tunnel-visioned onto scoring... It needs a little more thought since we don't currently have a way to affect combo but not score. The closest we can get right now is awarding 30 score via `LargeTick` judgements but that's still different to stable.

@peppy what's your thoughts on this? In short, we've got `SmallTick` that affects only the accuracy portion, and `SmallBonus`/`LargeBonus` that affect only the bonus portion, but nothing that affects only the combo portion: https://github.com/ppy/osu/wiki/Scoring#score .
We can either go down the path of using `LargeTick` and awarding 30 score for hits within any of the non-miss window, and accept that there's a difference in scoring, or add a `ComboHit`/`ComboMiss` hit result specifically for this case.
